Post-conviction DNA testing-procedure
SF0101
amendments.
Sponsored By: Senator(s) Landen, Case, Crago, Crum and Nethercott
and Representative(s) Brady, Bratten, Filer, Harshman
and Washut
AN ACT relating to criminal procedure; amending the date of conviction for
purposes of when a due diligence showing is required before post-conviction DNA
testing; and providing for an effective date.
